{"abstract":"In response to the Russian Federation's (Russia's) ongoing aggression against Ukraine, as substantially enabled by Belarus, the Department of Commerce is expanding and strengthening the existing sanctions against Russia and Belarus, including the scope of the Export Administration Regulations (EAR)'s Russian and Belarusian industry sector sanctions and `luxury goods' sanctions. This rule also refines existing export controls on Russia and Belarus. The Department of Commerce is taking these actions to enhance the effectiveness of its controls on both countries and to better align them with those implemented by U.S. allies and partners.","action":"Final rule.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","name":"Commerce Department","id":54,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","parent_id":null,"slug":"commerce-department"},{"raw_name":"Bureau of Industry and Security","name":"Industry and Security Bureau","id":241,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/industry-and-security-bureau","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/241","parent_id":54,"slug":"industry-and-security-bureau"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2023/02/27/2023-03927.html","cfr_references":[{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"744","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"746","title":15}],"citation":"88 FR 12175","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"This rule is effective on February 24, 2023.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Docket No. 230221-0047"],"dockets":[{"supporting_documents":[],"agency_name":"BIS","documents":[{"comment_count":0,"comment_start_date":"2023-02-27","updated_at":"2023-04-25T18:27:42.212-04:00","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/BIS-2023-0008-0001","allow_late_comments":null,"id":"BIS-2023-0008-0001